OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few light
OL,6,Fshowers persisting at first this
OL,7,Fevening but most places dry. Further
OL,8,Fshowery outbreaks arrive overnight,
OL,9,Fturning heavy at times and milder than
OL,10,Frecent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAnother mixed day with
OL,13,Foccasional sunny intervals and
OL,14,Fshowers. These heavy at times, with
OL,15,Fthe risk of thunder. Temperatures
OL,16,Fclose to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
