OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FShowery outbreaks of rain clearing
OL,7,Fthrough Thursday. Turning drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter on Friday and into Saturday.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average with frost
OL,10,Fovernight.
